# Eval run output. The experiments (experiment.yaml + tasks/) are the artefact worth
# reviewing; a summary is a timestamped reading of one machine on one day, and committing
# them turns every run into a diff. Re-run to reproduce: `ix run <name> --lab lab`.
lab/*/results/
